                "observations": [
                    "src/recognition/segment.ts:131-134,141: the open run has no SEGMENT_MAX_MS cap (only finished runs are dropped in keep). With a hand resting in the lap or a caregiver in view the open run grows without bound. NG-54 re-running segmentStream per frame on the whole history costs O(n) per frame and returns already-finished segments again, so NG-54 must trim consumed frames, dedupe emitted segments by tMs, and cap or discard an open run longer than SEGMENT_MAX_MS.",
